flowchart LR
    Client --> API[FastAPI: identity scope + request ID]
    API --> Guard[Prompt guard]
    Guard --> Service[AgentService: budgets, session, traces]
    Service <--> Cache[Tenant/session TTL-LRU cache]
    Service --> Agent[LlamaIndex FunctionAgent / ReActAgent]
    Agent <--> LLM[NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Ultra]
    Agent --> CourseTool[Course retrieval-only tool]
    Agent --> PaperTool[Research retrieval-only tool]
    Agent --> Other[arXiv / definition / calculator / summarizer]
    CourseTool --> CourseIndex[Course persisted index]
    PaperTool --> PaperIndex[Paper persisted index]
    CourseIndex <--> Embed[NVIDIA embedding API]
    PaperIndex <--> Embed
    Service --> Citation[Citation validation]
    Citation --> API
    Service -.-> Metrics[Prometheus + JSON logs]
